{"title":"소녀신선","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cBExtK/hzXarZMoi1/9kZ8G0R4sDblw6AY2KBAC1&filename=th3","synopsis":"수능을 며칠 앞둔 고3 수험생 하버들은\n밤늦은 귀갓길에 우연히 도깨비를 만나\n무릉도원으로 끌려가고 만다. \n\n도망치던 버들은 실수로 그만 이무기 꽝철의 봉인을 풀어버리고\n그곳의 신선으로부터 다음 신선이 되라는 명을 받는데..?!\n\n재수생 버들이는 성격 더러운 꽝철이,\n신선의 보좌인 안경 미남 청학,\n귀신 쫓는 개 삼목이와 함께 본격적인 신선생활을 시작한다.\n\n매일 영물과 요괴의 사건 사고가 끊이지 않는 \n중생구제 사무소의 신선 라이프!\n\n'제발 그냥 수험공부하게 날 좀 내버려 둬!!’","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":117,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":124,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":146,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":149,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":122,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":135,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":149,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":135,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":153,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":153,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":151,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":150,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":146,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":166,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":161,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":136,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":139,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":157,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":164,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"20